{"task_id": "HumanEval/59", "solution": "def largest_prime_factor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the largest prime factor of n.\n    Assume n > 1 and is not a prime.\n    \"\"\"\n    largest_factor = 1\n    d = 2\n    temp_n = n\n\n    while d * d <= temp_n:\n        if temp_n % d == 0:\n            largest_factor = d\n            while temp_n % d == 0:\n                temp_n //= d\n        d += 1\n\n    if temp_n > 1: # The remaining temp_n is the largest prime factor.\n        largest_factor = temp_n\n\n    return largest_factor"}
