{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "class FibFibCalculator:\n    def __init__(self):\n        # Initialize memoization cache with base cases.\n        self._memo = {\n            0: 0,\n            1: 0,\n            2: 1\n        }\n\n    def calculate(self, n: int) -> int:\n        # Handle negative input as an error, and return memoized values if available.\n        if n < 0:\n            raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' cannot be negative for FibFib sequence.\")\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n\n        # Recursively compute the value and store it in the memoization cache.\n        result = self.calculate(n - 1) + self.calculate(n - 2) + self.calculate(n - 3)\n        self._memo[n] = result\n        return result\n_fibfib_calculator_instance = FibFibCalculator()\ndef fibfib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th element of the FibFib number sequence using memoization for efficiency.\n    Raises ValueError for negative input.\n    \"\"\"\n    return _fibfib_calculator_instance.calculate(n)"}
