{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "def encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string using a rotational cipher.\n    Lowercase letters are shifted down by 4 places, non-lowercase characters remain unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    SHIFT_AMOUNT = 4  # The alphabet should be rotated by two multiplied to two places (2 * 2 = 4).\n    encrypted_chars = []\n    for char in s:\n        if 'a' <= char <= 'z':\n            start_ascii = ord('a')\n            char_pos = ord(char) - start_ascii\n            shifted_pos = (char_pos + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % 26\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(start_ascii + shifted_pos))\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n    return ''.join(encrypted_chars)"}
