{"task_id": "HumanEval/154", "solution": "def cycpattern_check(a , b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if any cyclic rotation of word 'b' is a substring of word 'a'.\n    An empty string 'b' is considered a substring of any 'a'.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not b:\n        return True\n\n    # Generate all unique cyclic rotations of string b.\n    rotations = set()\n    n = len(b)\n    for i in range(n):\n        rotated_b = b[i:] + b[:i]\n        rotations.add(rotated_b)\n    \n    # Check if any generated rotation is a substring of a.\n    for rotation in rotations:\n        if rotation in a:\n            return True\n            \n    return False"}
